1️⃣ Data Collection

Pull all product data via Shopify’s GraphQL API:

Product title

Current description

Variants

Tags / categories

Images (optional if using AI for image-based description suggestions)

Metadata (SEO info, alt text, URL handle)

This is your raw input for processing.

2️⃣ Scoring / Analysis

Run each product through your QualiScore system:

Readability

SEO & metadata

Brand voice consistency

Completeness

Persuasiveness

Store the score and flagged improvement areas for each product.

⚡ Tip: Flag products below a certain threshold (e.g., 70/100) for bulk AI improvements.

