5️⃣ Validation & Quality Check

Optional: Run AI or rule-based check for:

Grammar / spelling errors

Readability score

SEO keywords

Brand tone

Only push descriptions that pass a minimum threshold automatically; others can be flagged for merchant review.

6️⃣ Bulk Push to Shopify

Use GraphQL Admin API bulk mutation:

Update product.descriptionHtml

Update title / seoTitle / seoDescription if needed

Update image alt text if part of AI workflow

Optional: Provide rollback / versioning in case merchant wants to revert.

7️⃣ Reporting & Feedback Loop

Generate a post-update report:

Old score → new score

Improvements made

Products still below threshold

Conversion / engagement tracking (optional)

This helps merchants see the value instantly.
